 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A ray $r$ defined by origin $o$ and direction $d$, and a Sparse Voxel Octree (SVO) stored in a linear block structure.
-*   **Output:** The distance $t$ to the closest intersected voxel, or $-1$ if no intersection is found.
